/E (across eastern, southern and western Africa," said Chief Executive, Lyndsay Handler. "It's still amazing to me that so many people in Uganda do not have access to power. We provide a decentralised, affordable home system that can completely transform lives. An opportunity to rethink the way that we can achieve universal access to energy," she said.)
